  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Algoma University is a small and welcoming public university in Ontario, Canada. Across its campuses, Algoma offers a variety of undergraduate degrees, graduate programmes, and professional certificates.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Student life at Algoma University is warm and community-oriented. It’s a tight-knit university with small classes. Here, you’ll find cultural events, student clubs, recreation activities, workshops, and a strong emphasis on wellbeing.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Algoma offers comfortable student housing options in the Sault Ste. Marie campus. These residences are centrally located on the campus and are within a two-minute walk to classes.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>Algoma’s main library, the Arthur A. Wishart Library, offers quiet study areas and digital resources.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>On the Timmins campus, students have access to the Northern College fitness centre, which includes cardio equipment, weights, a sauna, and activity areas.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll find several labs at the university, including the Gaming Technology Laboratory for game development, the Digital Innovation Lab focusing on AI for real-world challenges, and science labs in the Convergence Centre.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>Algoma University has several on-campus cafes and food options, including Tim Hortons, Pizza, Dayside Cafe, and the Belltower Cafe. Plus, Algoma University Students’ Union offers various meal plans for students living in the university’s residences.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
